WEBVTT

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:24.500
<i>The 20th Anniversary Festival?</i>

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:30.790
Yup. We merchants invite
caravans here and have a huge festival!

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:33.370
We'll be busy, too.

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:36.700
Once the sheep arrive,
please help me prepare them, Ilie.

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.250
Will Kidow go to festival, too?

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.540
Do you think he'd be interested?

00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:53.080
Oh, my!

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:55.160
My, my! My, my!

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:07.500
Why?!

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:11.700
Why are you in my room
without permission?!

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:13.330
I'm looking for something.

00:01:13.870 --> 00:01:15.950
Remember this used to be a storage room?

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:23.580
You didn't see anything, did you?

00:01:25.540 --> 00:01:27.660
I don't care about your personal stuff.

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:30.160
More importantly,
if you find another glove,

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:31.750
-can you bring it to me?
-Yeah.

00:01:31.870 --> 00:01:34.500
Yeah, okay! Bye, then!

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:39.830
By the way, you know that notebook on
the desk with weird poems written in it?

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.700
There were a couple
vocabulary errors in it.

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:43.750
<i>Poem...</i>

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:45.620
<i>Poem...</i>

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:47.450
<i>Poem!</i>

00:01:48.950 --> 00:01:49.830
Ouch!

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:51.080
Hey!

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:52.950
You peeping Tom...

00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:56.330
What?

00:01:57.870 --> 00:01:58.700
Nothing...

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:39.330
Jeez.

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:41.750
How dare he look at my diary
without permission.

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:44.950
I know it was partly my fault
for leaving it out, too,

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:47.700
but he won't even come down for breakfast?

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:49.330
Is he scared of me?

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:51.870
Gosh, how rude!

00:03:54.910 --> 00:03:56.000
A festival, huh?

00:04:05.790 --> 00:04:08.040
What? The sheep still haven't come?

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:10.450
If they don't get here,
I'll demand a full refund!

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:13.500
I'll also add compensatory damages
and ban you from my store!

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:15.000
Come on...

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:17.200
Just wait a little longer? Please?

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:19.750
Is this what Kidow was asking you for?

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:22.120
Yes, this is Tania.

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:24.290
No way.

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:29.040
Well, I'm definitely closer
in terms of beauty.

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:31.910
And what are you doing, Kidow?

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:33.660
Where is she?

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.330
Ilie went out.

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:37.790
She said she's going to see her friends.

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:46.700
What should I do?

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:47.660
Ilie.

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:50.330
Over here!

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:52.620
And this is...?

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:55.500
This is Team Red Rats' secret shortcut.

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:57.950
Even the military doesn't know about this.

00:04:58.700 --> 00:05:00.910
Why is that area off-limits?

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:04.080
Because it's almost the festival.

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:07.750
If we get caught in sight,
it looks bad for the city.

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:11.450
Is the area where Naji
and his grandfather live okay?

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:13.750
Yeah, he'll be fine.

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:17.080
<i>He started a business</i>
<i>for the guards on watch.</i>

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:18.580
I see...

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:20.660
By the way, are you...

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:21.750
What?

00:05:22.370 --> 00:05:24.160
Are you Kidow's <i>this?</i>

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:25.910
This?

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:28.250
This means...

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:31.290
you know, like always acting
lovey-dovey...

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:33.160
What?!

00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:36.200
-Of course not!
-Lizzy! Sheep! Sheep!

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:37.700
-Sheep!
-It's going that way!

00:05:41.410 --> 00:05:42.370
Don't come this way!

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:44.500
-It's coming back!
-Wait, wait!

00:05:44.580 --> 00:05:45.450
Hey, you guys!

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:46.370
Lizzy!

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:52.200
Now, let's take one!

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:56.250
Celebrating the Qasim Tank's completion!

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:01.250
Unacceptable!

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:03.700
You call this a job for the Tank Unit?

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:05.160
It's work.

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:07.250
How's the speed?

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:08.620
No problem.

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:13.250
Don't worry. We'll save you right now.

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:14.750
We're pulling the rope!

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:16.080
Go ahead!

00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:21.330
-Hurry!
-Pull!

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:33.790
You again?

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:35.950
Thanks, Mr. Kidow.

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:37.000
What's that about?

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:39.450
Kidow, thank you for coming.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:42.200
It was crying at the bottom
of the sand pit.

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:44.790
We went to save it and almost got eaten.

00:06:45.410 --> 00:06:46.950
The bug used bait?

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:49.580
That's the story.

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:53.000
You have any good ideas, Mr. Kidow?

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:57.950
The festival will become its buffet...
That ain't good.

00:06:58.450 --> 00:07:00.500
Yeah, if it gets inside,

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:03.580
it'll be another Tragedy of the
West Gate from five years ago.

00:07:05.120 --> 00:07:07.080
We'll just do the same thing.

00:07:07.950 --> 00:07:09.290
Offer a sacrifice,

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:12.830
and once it pops its head out,
we'll blow it up along with the bait.

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:14.950
Don't talk crazy.

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:18.950
I can't order my men
to become bait for the bug.

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:21.540
If this were the Far East,
we'd finish in two seconds.

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:26.290
But until the bug's entire body
is lured out from the sand,

00:07:26.370 --> 00:07:28.620
the bait would need
the skills to hold out.

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:42.830
I've got these words I've never
been able to get out of my head.

00:07:43.910 --> 00:07:48.330
They're from when we burned all the bugs
along with the west gate five years ago...

00:07:54.830 --> 00:07:56.950
You okay?
I'll take you to the shelter now.

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:58.790
What do you want now?!

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:01.700
Thanks to all your fire, my mom's dead!

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:03.450
To us,

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:06.000
you guys are no different than bugs!

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:07.580
You're all just murderers!

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:13.120
We had no choice.

00:08:13.410 --> 00:08:15.120
If we didn't sacrifice this place,

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:17.620
the damage would've spread
to all of 05...

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:21.450
But how could I ever...

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:24.790
tell those children who lost
their parents and homes as a result

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:28.660
that we had no choice...

00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:35.330
About what you were saying earlier,
you think I can become that bait?

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:39.250
I don't intend to survive.

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:41.660
I'll give my life up if I have to.

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:46.000
Teach me the so-called way
of the Far East.

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:47.540
Please.

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:52.950
A truck?

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:55.700
What we're looking for is sheep here!

00:08:56.580 --> 00:08:57.410
This might be...

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:00.870
the truck carrying the sheep
that Ms. Mario was talking about...

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:05.790
There's no one inside.

00:09:10.910 --> 00:09:12.790
-I'll go.
-Ilie?

00:09:13.120 --> 00:09:15.450
Don't worry, if it's sheep,
leave it to me!

00:09:16.250 --> 00:09:19.750
No way. Even if you were a shepherd,
we're in an underground passage here.

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:22.000
A hat?

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:27.950
<i>This city's underground passages are</i>
<i>from before this region was numbered E-05.</i>

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:32.290
We were refused any data
on the former city,

00:09:32.410 --> 00:09:35.500
so the interior area, structure,
and details are all unknown.

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:38.540
<i>The point where the sheep</i>
<i>transport truck was attacked</i>

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:41.830
<i>was 1.5 km west of E-05's outer walls.</i>

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:45.870
<i>There's only one underground passage</i>
<i>that a sand bug could fit into.</i>

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:50.790
<i>We'll set black, blue, green, yellow,</i>
<i>and red lights every 200 meters</i>

00:09:51.120 --> 00:09:54.540
as well as high-sensitivity
cameras and mics inside.

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:57.540
<i>And we'll have an extermination team</i>
<i>on standby to stop it.</i>

00:09:58.290 --> 00:10:00.700
<i>Wait until the engineering unit</i>
<i>closes the firewalls</i>

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:02.830
in the underground electric room.

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:05.000
We're gonna protect
the red with our lives.

00:10:12.080 --> 00:10:14.120
How come I'm not on the front line?

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:16.870
If it gets past blue, green, and yellow,

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:18.750
who's going to protect this city?

00:10:19.120 --> 00:10:20.910
That's the last stronghold!

00:10:21.580 --> 00:10:22.870
The last stronghold?

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:25.000
I see, roger that!

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:26.580
Come on, hurry it up!

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:30.160
What's that?

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:34.620
If the Tank Unit fails,
we have to stop it here.

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:38.250
If you use that, the part of town
where the children live will blow up!

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:40.160
Damn it...

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:50.160
Give me a break.
This is when I rake in the money.

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:52.950
I'm sorry, we couldn't get ahold of Lizzy.

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:55.790
Lizzy's with Ilie and-- What's this?

00:10:55.910 --> 00:10:57.910
Most of the detailed parts
are all censored.

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:01.120
It's an emergency. We need to know
about the underground passages.

00:11:02.290 --> 00:11:06.080
There are three main routes that connect
from the western wasteland to the city.

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:08.200
Three?

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:21.080
What's all this?!

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:22.120
One route left now.

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:24.950
I guess they're saying to use
the Tank Unit for the rest.

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:27.790
What do you mean by an emergency?!
Lizzy and them were saying

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:31.040
something about some sheep
are in the underground passages right now!

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:32.870
-What?
-It can't be...

00:11:33.450 --> 00:11:34.830
What was that tremor just now?

00:11:35.200 --> 00:11:37.790
<i>The vigilantes went and</i>
<i>blew up the passages on their own!</i>

00:11:37.950 --> 00:11:40.330
Qasim, Lizzy and the others
are down there!

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:43.450
-What?!
<i>-Qasim, don't move from there!</i>

00:11:43.540 --> 00:11:45.450
-Ilie, too?
-I think they're together!

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:46.950
I'll go.

00:11:47.410 --> 00:11:48.950
I'll make sure to bring them back.

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:50.950
You wait right here.

00:11:52.410 --> 00:11:53.410
Exterminator...

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:01.040
There!

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:10.450
I finally caught up to you!

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:11.370
Lizzy...

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:13.700
Way to go, ex-shepherd!

00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:15.660
You even made a fence.

00:12:16.620 --> 00:12:18.370
Lizzy, run.

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:21.870
I said run!

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:25.790
What... What's wrong, Ilie?!

00:12:32.830 --> 00:12:36.120
Hey, where's your boss and Ilie?

00:12:36.200 --> 00:12:38.410
The dude with the spiky hair!

00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:41.950
If it's Lizzy and Ilie, they went to
catch sheep and haven't come back.

00:12:44.040 --> 00:12:45.080
Sheep!

00:12:45.620 --> 00:12:46.620
Catch them!

00:12:48.540 --> 00:12:50.040
-Got him!
-Gotcha!

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:51.620
Wait!

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:53.950
Damn it...

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:56.500
Get away!

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:59.500
You guys, run toward the red lights
like there's no tomorrow!

00:12:59.580 --> 00:13:00.870
-Kidow!
-Go!

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:05.500
<i>Rifles won't work!</i>
<i>It's no use ganging up on it!</i>

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:08.410
Did you all hear that?
We're going to rearrange plans.

00:13:08.500 --> 00:13:10.660
Everyone pull out of blue to red!

00:13:10.750 --> 00:13:12.160
<i>We'll use the flamethrowers!</i>

00:13:12.790 --> 00:13:14.790
Go ahead if you wanna suffocate and die!

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:18.500
<i>Mr. Kidow, the gate will close</i>
<i>in five minutes! Get out before then!</i>

00:13:18.950 --> 00:13:19.910
Okay!

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:31.000
Leave that there.

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:35.410
I said to leave it there!

00:13:40.620 --> 00:13:43.250
Now, come! The bait's right here!

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:02.790
I can't run anymore.

00:14:02.870 --> 00:14:04.000
Me neither...

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:07.500
We let the bug go past.

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:09.370
The target's entering green.

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:14.750
Green, camera No. 1, lost!

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:17.500
Power has recovered.
We'll begin closing the gates.

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:21.660
Green, yellow,
confirmed gate's activation.

00:14:23.450 --> 00:14:24.450
What about red?!

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:26.080
<i>It's no good, it won't move!</i>

00:14:30.290 --> 00:14:32.910
<i>Target has passed green.</i>
<i>Now entering yellow.</i>

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:35.120
<i>What's wrong with red? It's not closing!</i>

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:38.200
Boss, take Ilie to the surface.

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:42.290
Team Red Rats' mark
is on the left wall 500 meters ahead!

00:14:42.870 --> 00:14:45.330
If you turn right there, that's W-07.

00:14:46.540 --> 00:14:48.370
I forgot this place was your guys' town.

00:14:57.410 --> 00:14:58.750
It's entered the red area!

00:15:10.580 --> 00:15:12.080
<i>This is a stronghold.</i>

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:14.540
I won't allow you to break through.

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:16.250
Get back, monster!

00:15:16.910 --> 00:15:18.750
Past this point is the world of mankind!

00:15:19.910 --> 00:15:20.750
Qasim...

00:15:22.450 --> 00:15:24.830
What's the matter?
Why aren't you attacking?

00:15:28.660 --> 00:15:31.040
Are your memories as a former human

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:33.290
pitying this soldier that's about to die?

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:36.790
<i>Red gate, activated!</i>

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:38.290
Qasim, get back!

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:40.750
<i>Qasim, respond!</i>

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:43.700
<i>The gate's closing!</i>
<i>You're gonna get locked in!</i>

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:46.000
I leave the rest to you all!

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:49.200
Qasim!

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:17.870
Where's the bug?!

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:19.700
I can't see a thing!

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:22.200
<i>Damn it. </i>

00:16:22.950 --> 00:16:23.870
<i>I can't see!</i>

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:27.000
<i>Are the children okay?! Where's Lizzy?</i>

00:16:27.370 --> 00:16:28.950
<i>Lizzy! Lizzy!</i>

00:16:37.790 --> 00:16:38.950
<i>I couldn't forgive them.</i>

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:42.580
<i>Both the Exterminators</i>
<i>and the military who sacrificed us.</i>

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:51.870
I hate military soldiers
and they don't care about us either.

00:16:53.330 --> 00:16:55.910
But... there's this one idiot.

00:16:57.000 --> 00:17:00.700
I don't know if it's
to make up for his crimes,

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:05.040
<i>but that idiot would come and take care</i>
<i>of us every time he visited the slums.</i>

00:17:06.450 --> 00:17:07.450
He's a good person.

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:11.080
It's been five years already.
He's just an idiot.

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:16.790
I didn't know he was such an idiot,

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:18.410
that's why I said that to him.

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:21.450
I called him a murderer back then.

00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:24.700
I don't understand it myself.

00:17:25.450 --> 00:17:28.040
I can't forgive him,
but I don't have a grudge.

00:17:28.620 --> 00:17:30.790
I wanna tell him "That's enough," but...

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:34.250
Apologize! Just apologize to him!

00:17:35.660 --> 00:17:38.330
Why didn't I think of something
so simple...

00:17:39.250 --> 00:17:42.250
Just because he came into my room
without asking and read my poems,

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:44.250
a "peeping Tom" is too much, right?

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:45.160
A peeping Tom?

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:48.250
Let's do our best, Lizzy.

00:17:49.410 --> 00:17:50.370
You're right.

00:17:51.160 --> 00:17:53.660
Okay. Thanks, Ilie.

00:17:56.200 --> 00:18:00.540
The Sheep of Miracles that outlived
the attack of a giant Cagaster!

00:18:01.580 --> 00:18:04.000
Get your tasty Miracle Mutton!

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:05.370
Miracle Mutton?

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:06.540
Sounds very good!

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:07.620
Give me one.

00:18:07.700 --> 00:18:09.160
I'll have a mutton chop, too!

00:18:09.250 --> 00:18:10.950
Two mutton chops!

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:12.120
Coming up!

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:14.160
-We have some cold lemonade, too!
-Yeah!

00:18:19.040 --> 00:18:20.790
It's well made!

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:25.660
Hurry, come on!

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:27.160
You working hard?

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:28.700
Work hard, Qasim!

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:29.950
Qasim!

00:18:31.450 --> 00:18:34.120
What, you're still not off yet?

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:36.160
I'm just chilling for a bit.

00:18:36.750 --> 00:18:39.790
Putting it off won't help fix
a woman's temper.

00:18:42.540 --> 00:18:44.410
What a difficult fellow. Here.

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:45.790
Hold out your hand.

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:50.620
This peddler girl sold it to me,

00:18:50.700 --> 00:18:52.700
but I don't have anyone to give it to.

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:56.000
Just give it to your place's little gal.

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:58.290
Why do I have to do something like that?

00:18:58.370 --> 00:19:00.540
You're not good with words, are you?

00:19:00.870 --> 00:19:03.580
All you have to do is apologize
and show her your sincerity.

00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:05.950
There's no point in being stubborn.

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:09.750
Hey. Don't you hate me...?

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:12.700
I don't like Exterminators in general.

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:16.910
But I don't exactly hate you as a person.

00:19:17.620 --> 00:19:19.330
Now, do your best.

00:19:19.750 --> 00:19:20.750
Hey.

00:19:21.370 --> 00:19:22.250
What?

00:19:23.950 --> 00:19:24.790
Nothing.

00:19:25.620 --> 00:19:28.080
Well, all right.
Tell me when you feel like it.

00:19:28.750 --> 00:19:30.660
I'm still older than you.

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:32.910
If you need advice, I'll be here.

00:19:36.290 --> 00:19:37.250
Advice, eh?

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:51.500
Qasim!

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:54.950
What are you doing there?

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:57.700
My feet led me here.

00:19:58.540 --> 00:20:00.040
The little ones aren't with you?

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:02.080
They're working at Mario's place.

00:20:02.410 --> 00:20:06.000
But I bet they're stuffing themselves full
of mutton with the customers by now.

00:20:06.660 --> 00:20:08.450
Well, they sure deserve it.

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:11.410
Hey.

00:20:12.410 --> 00:20:14.500
Well done on exterminating the bug.

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:17.700
In the place of the townspeople
who don't know that,

00:20:17.830 --> 00:20:21.500
I'll represent everyone and you know...

00:20:21.580 --> 00:20:23.620
That's my job.

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:27.330
By the way, I know it's been a long time,

00:20:28.000 --> 00:20:29.790
but a friend I made recently

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:32.660
said that I need to come out
and say what I wanna say.

00:20:33.500 --> 00:20:36.370
So, will you forget...

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:38.660
what I said five years ago?

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:42.910
I... don't think you're a murderer.

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:45.500
That's why...

00:21:02.450 --> 00:21:03.370
That's all.

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:05.620
I'll see you tomorrow, then!

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:13.290
Qasim?

00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:22.370
Qasim?!

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:25.120
Hey, what's wrong?!

00:21:25.290 --> 00:21:26.160
Don't come close!

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:42.200
You're kidding, right?

00:21:43.950 --> 00:21:46.160
Qasim just died...

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:50.200
There's only a monster here!

00:21:51.120 --> 00:21:51.950
Shoot me...

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:53.540
Please!

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:02.330
Don't!

00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:05.000
Don't kill him, please!

00:22:18.750 --> 00:22:20.450
<i>You overlooked a Cagaster outbreak?</i>

00:22:21.040 --> 00:22:23.200
You know what'll happen
if too much time passes!

00:22:23.500 --> 00:22:26.450
No, I told him not to kill him.

00:22:27.160 --> 00:22:28.200
'Cause...

00:22:28.290 --> 00:22:31.200
'Cause Qasim hasn't done anything wrong.

00:22:31.870 --> 00:22:34.580
He hasn't done anything to get killed for!

00:22:35.200 --> 00:22:37.080
Hadi, is it Qasim?

00:22:37.250 --> 00:22:38.790
The Cagaster outbreak?

00:22:40.200 --> 00:22:41.040
Yeah.

00:22:41.330 --> 00:22:42.700
How many minutes have passed?

00:22:43.540 --> 00:22:46.660
Supposedly with the ring of the bells.
There's eight minutes left.

00:22:47.160 --> 00:22:48.000
I understand.

00:22:49.700 --> 00:22:51.160
Wait, I'll do it.

00:22:52.000 --> 00:22:53.250
He's my partner.

00:22:54.370 --> 00:22:55.500
Let me do it.

00:22:55.580 --> 00:22:56.660
Then take his head.

00:22:57.830 --> 00:22:59.580
The torso's already hardening.

00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:01.160
Guns won't work.

00:23:30.620 --> 00:23:32.040
I knew it'd be you.

00:23:33.120 --> 00:23:34.250
Sorry for the trouble.

00:23:37.160 --> 00:23:38.790
You have any last words?

00:23:40.540 --> 00:23:41.620
Let's see...

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:01.290
Sorry.

00:24:01.870 --> 00:24:04.910
Looks like I won't be able
to give you any advice.

00:24:21.080 --> 00:24:22.000
Hadi.

00:24:22.450 --> 00:24:23.330
That's enough.

00:24:24.040 --> 00:24:24.910
Let him rest.

00:24:25.790 --> 00:24:26.620
Why?

00:24:27.830 --> 00:24:29.700
There's so many others...

00:24:30.790 --> 00:24:34.040
There's countless other
good-for-nothings around...

00:24:35.250 --> 00:24:36.660
Why did it have to be you?

00:24:37.540 --> 00:24:40.660
Why did you have to die this way?!

00:24:42.450 --> 00:24:43.290
Why...

00:24:44.750 --> 00:24:46.540
Sorry my men gave you trouble.

00:24:47.000 --> 00:24:49.080
The Tank Unit
will pay the extermination fee.

00:24:49.750 --> 00:24:51.950
Will you send the bill in a few days?

00:25:01.750 --> 00:25:03.700
Qasim... What happened to Qasim?!

00:25:05.790 --> 00:25:06.910
You murder--

00:25:12.660 --> 00:25:13.500
Kidow!

00:25:13.580 --> 00:25:15.040
-Kidow's back!
-Kidow!

00:25:15.120 --> 00:25:16.040
Hey, Kidow!

00:25:20.830 --> 00:25:22.410
Hey, take out your hand.

00:25:23.580 --> 00:25:24.410
I borrowed it.

00:25:25.250 --> 00:25:26.750
Do whatever you want with it.

00:25:26.950 --> 00:25:28.080
Bro...

00:25:28.330 --> 00:25:29.750
Kidow, is that...?

00:25:30.290 --> 00:25:31.910
I... I...

00:25:32.410 --> 00:25:33.250
What?

00:25:54.750 --> 00:25:56.750
If you need advice, I'll be here.
